---
import BookingStatus from '../../BookingStatus.astro';
---

<div class="services-v8-page">
  <section class="inner-hero services-v8__hero" aria-labelledby="services-page-title">
    <div class="section-shell inner-hero__grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">SERVICES</p>
        <h1 id="services-page-title">From injury<br /><span>to performance.</span></h1>
      </div>
      <div class="inner-hero__aside">
        <p class="hero-lede">Whether you're dealing with an injury, recovering from surgery, trying to get back to your sport, or simply want to move and perform at your best, Forge provides individualized care built around your goals.</p>
        <BookingStatus />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="services-directory-v8" aria-labelledby="service-directory-title">
    <div class="section-shell">
      <header class="services-v8__heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">WHAT WE DO</p>
          <h2 id="service-directory-title">Care that progresses with you.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Each service is built around the same goal: move from assessment and symptom management toward strength, capacity, and confident return to the things that matter to you.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="services-v8__layout">
        <div class="services-v8__sidebar mobile-jump-menu">
          <button type="button" class="mobile-jump-menu__summary" id="services-jump-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="services-jump-nav">
            <span class="mobile-jump-menu__active-text" data-jump-text>Jump to section...</span>
            <span class="mobile-jump-menu__icon" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
          </button>
          <nav id="services-jump-nav" aria-label="Services Directory">
            <ul>
              <li><a href="#service-ortho" data-scroll-spy-link="service-ortho">Orthopedic Physical Therapy</a></li>
              <li><a href="#service-sports" data-scroll-spy-link="service-sports">Sports &amp; Injury Rehabilitation</a></li>
              <li><a href="#service-postop" data-scroll-spy-link="service-postop">Post-Operative Rehabilitation</a></li>
              <li><a href="#service-return" data-scroll-spy-link="service-return">Return to Sport &amp; Activity</a></li>
              <li><a href="#service-strength" data-scroll-spy-link="service-strength">Strength &amp; Performance</a></li>
            </ul>
          </nav>
        </div>

        <div class="services-v8__feed">
          <article id="service-ortho">
            <h3>Orthopedic Physical Therapy</h3>
            <p>Physical therapy at Forge is designed to identify the factors contributing to your symptoms and create a plan to get you back to the activities that matter to you.</p>
            <h4>Treatment may include</h4>
            <ul class="services-v8__list">
              <li>Comprehensive movement and strength assessment</li>
              <li>Manual therapy when appropriate</li>
              <li>Therapeutic exercise</li>
              <li>Progressive strength training</li>
              <li>Mobility and movement work</li>
              <li>Neuromuscular re-education</li>
              <li>Education and self-management strategies</li>
              <li>Individualized home exercise programming</li>
            </ul>
            <figure class="services-v8__media">
              <img src="/assets/hero_mobility.jpg" width="896" height="1200" alt="Mobility exercise in gym" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
            </figure>
            <div class="services-v8__condition-list">
              <div>
                <h4>Knee &amp; Lower Extremity</h4>
                <ul><li>Knee pain</li><li>Patellofemoral pain</li><li>Tendinopathies</li><li>ACL rehabilitation</li><li>Meniscus injuries</li><li>Hip and lower-extremity injuries</li><li>Ankle/foot ligamentous injuries</li></ul>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4>Shoulder &amp; Upper Extremity</h4>
                <ul><li>Shoulder pain</li><li>Rotator cuff injuries</li><li>Labral injuries</li><li>Elbow and wrist conditions</li><li>Throwing-related injuries</li></ul>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4>Spine</h4>
                <ul><li>Low back pain</li><li>Neck pain</li><li>Cervical and lumbar conditions</li><li>Radicular symptoms</li></ul>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4>Other Orthopedic Conditions</h4>
                <ul><li>Tendon and muscle injuries</li><li>Joint pain</li><li>Overuse injuries</li><li>Movement-related pain</li></ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article id="service-sports">
            <h3>Sports &amp; Injury Rehabilitation</h3>
            <p>Athletes need more than pain relief. They need to be prepared for the demands of their sport. Forge rehabilitation progresses from restoring basic movement and strength to the specific demands of your activity.</p>
            <div class="services-v8__condition-list">
              <div><h4>Running</h4><p>Impact, speed, distance, and training volume.</p></div>
              <div><h4>Strength Training</h4><p>Progressive return to lifting and resistance training.</p></div>
              <div><h4>Field &amp; Court Sports</h4><p>Jumping, landing, acceleration, deceleration, cutting, and change of direction.</p></div>
              <div><h4>Recreational Sports</h4><p>Golf, tennis, skiing, cycling, pickleball, and more.</p></div>
            </div>
            <p class="services-v8__callout">Don't just get back in the game. Be prepared to stay there.</p>
          </article>

          <article id="service-postop">
            <h3>Post-Operative Rehabilitation</h3>
            <p>Forge works within your surgeon's protocol while progressively rebuilding your mobility, strength, control, and capacity.</p>
            <h4>Common rehabilitation may include</h4>
            <ul class="services-v8__list services-v8__list--two">
              <li>ACL reconstruction</li><li>Meniscus procedures</li><li>Rotator cuff procedures</li><li>Shoulder stabilization</li><li>Joint replacement</li><li>Other orthopedic procedures</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Your rehabilitation progresses based on your procedure, your recovery, and your goals.</p>
            <figure class="services-v8__media">
              <img src="/assets/hero_rehabilitation.jpg" width="896" height="1200" alt="Rehabilitation session" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
            </figure>
          </article>

          <article id="service-return">
            <h3>Return to Sport &amp; Activity</h3>
            <p>Being able to perform an exercise in the clinic doesn't necessarily mean you're ready for your activity. Return-to-activity rehabilitation bridges that gap.</p>
            <div class="services-v8__progression" aria-label="Return to activity progression">
              <span>Strength</span><span>Power</span><span>Speed</span><span>Agility</span><span>Sport / Activity-Specific Demands</span>
            </div>
            <p>Whether you're returning to competitive sport or everyday activity, the goal is to make the transition back as confident as possible.</p>
          </article>

          <article id="service-strength">
            <h3>Strength &amp; Performance</h3>
            <p>Forge isn't only about recovering from injury. Strength and performance services are designed for active individuals who want to improve their physical capacity, move better, and build resilience.</p>
            <ul class="services-v8__list services-v8__list--two">
              <li>Strength development</li><li>Movement assessment</li><li>Mobility</li><li>Stability and control</li><li>Exercise programming</li><li>Performance-focused training</li><li>Training around previous injuries</li><li>Injury risk reduction</li>
            </ul>
            <blockquote>“I'm not injured. I just don't feel like I'm moving as well as I should.”</blockquote>
            <p>That's where we can help.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="decision-section surface-light services-v8__decision" aria-labelledby="service-fit-title">
    <div class="section-shell decision-section__grid">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT SERVICE IS RIGHT FOR ME?</p><h2 id="service-fit-title">You don't have to figure that out before you reach out.</h2></div>
      <div><p>Your first step is a comprehensive evaluation where we can understand what's going on, discuss your goals, and determine the best path forward.</p><a class="text-link" href="/concept-01/contact/">Have a question? Contact Forge <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="difference-strip services-v8__difference" aria-labelledby="difference-title">
    <div class="section-shell difference-strip__grid">
      <p class="eyebrow">THE FORGE DIFFERENCE</p>
      <div><h2 id="difference-title">One-on-one. Evidence-based. Built around you.</h2><p>Every Forge service follows the same principle: your rehabilitation should be built around your goals—not a generic diagnosis.</p><a class="text-link" href="/concept-01/approach/">Explore the Forge Approach <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-v3-close services-v8__close" aria-labelledby="services-close-title">
    <div class="section-shell home-v3-close__grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">READY TO GET STARTED?</p><h2 id="services-close-title">Your goals. Your plan. Your next step.</h2><p>Whether you're recovering from an injury, returning to sport, or looking to perform at your best, Forge can help you build the path forward.</p></div><BookingStatus /></div>
  </section>
</div>

<script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
      entries.forEach(entry => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          const id = entry.target.getAttribute('id');
          document.querySelectorAll('[data-scroll-spy-link]').forEach(link => {
            link.classList.remove('is-active');
            if (link.getAttribute('data-scroll-spy-link') === id) {
              link.classList.add('is-active');
              // Update mobile summary text
              const jumpText = document.querySelector('.services-v8__sidebar [data-jump-text]');
              if (jumpText) {
                jumpText.textContent = link.textContent;
              }
            }
          });
        }
      });
    }, { rootMargin: '-20% 0px -70% 0px' });

    document.querySelectorAll('.services-v8__feed article').forEach(article => {
      observer.observe(article);
    });

    document.querySelectorAll('[data-scroll-spy-link]').forEach(link => {
      link.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        e.preventDefault();
        const targetId = link.getAttribute('href');
        if (!targetId) return;
        const targetElement = document.querySelector(targetId);
        if (targetElement) {
          targetElement.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' });
          // Close menu on mobile
          const menu = link.closest('.mobile-jump-menu');
          if (menu) {
            menu.classList.remove('is-open');
            const toggle = menu.querySelector('#services-jump-toggle');
            if (toggle) toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
          }
        }
      });
    });

    const jumpToggle = document.getElementById('services-jump-toggle');
    if (jumpToggle) {
      jumpToggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const menu = jumpToggle.closest('.mobile-jump-menu');
        if (menu) {
          const isOpen = menu.classList.toggle('is-open');
          jumpToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', isOpen ? 'true' : 'false');
        }
      });
    }
  });
</script>

<style>
  .services-v8__hero {
    padding-block: clamp(2.8rem, 4.8vw, 4.6rem);
  }

  .services-v8__hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(3.35rem, 5.8vw, 5.9rem);
  }

  .services-directory-v8 {
    padding: clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 4.5rem) 0;
    background: var(--surface-1, #131413);
  }

  .services-v8__heading {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr .85fr;
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
  }

  .services-v8__heading h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem);
  }

  .services-v8__heading > p {
    max-width: 35rem;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-dim, #999a94);
    font-size: .8rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    justify-self: end;
  }

  .services-v8__layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 16rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .services-v8__sidebar {
    position: sticky;
    top: 6rem;
  }

  .services-v8__sidebar nav {
    display: block;
  }

  .mobile-jump-menu__summary {
    display: none;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: left;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .services-v8__sidebar ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .services-v8__sidebar a {
    display: block;
    color: var(--text-faint, #6f716b);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .services-v8__sidebar a:hover {
    color: var(--ivory, #f1efe7);
  }

  .services-v8__sidebar a.is-active {
    color: var(--gold-bright, var(--gold, #dda947));
  }

  .services-v8__feed article {
    padding-bottom: 6rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line, #282a27);
    margin-bottom: 6rem;
    scroll-margin-top: 6rem;
  }

  .services-v8__feed article:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0;
    border-bottom: none;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .services-v8__feed h3 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
    color: var(--ivory, #f1efe7);
    font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .services-v8__feed p {
    color: var(--text-dim, #999a94);
    font-size: .85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .services-v8__feed h4 {
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--gold-bright, var(--gold, #dda947));
    font-size: .75rem;
    letter-spacing: .07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .services-v8__list {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    color: #b7b6b0;
    font-size: .8rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .services-v8__list li + li {
    margin-top: .4rem;
  }

  .services-v8__list--two {
    columns: 2;
    column-gap: 2rem;
  }

  .services-v8__media {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: var(--radius, 0.4rem);
    border: 1px solid #343732;
  }

  .services-v8__media img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-height: 24rem;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
    display: block;
    filter: grayscale(.15) contrast(1.06) brightness(.85);
  }

  .services-v8__condition-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .services-v8__condition-list h4 {
    margin: 0 0 .75rem;
  }

  .services-v8__condition-list ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    color: #b7b6b0;
    font-size: .8rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .services-v8__condition-list p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: .8rem;
    color: #b7b6b0;
  }

  .services-v8__callout,
  .services-v8__feed blockquote {
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--gold-bright, var(--gold, #dda947));
    color: var(--ivory, #f1efe7);
    font: 700 .9rem/1.45 'Oswald', sans-serif;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .services-v8__progression {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: .5rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .services-v8__progression span {
    padding: .5rem .75rem;
    border: 1px solid #373a35;
    color: #d4d1c9;
    font: 700 .75rem/1.25 'Oswald', sans-serif;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .services-v8__progression span:not(:last-child)::after {
    margin-left: .5rem;
    color: var(--gold-bright, var(--gold, #dda947));
    content: '→';
  }

  .services-v8__decision,
  .services-v8__difference,
  .services-v8__close {
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 4.5vw, 4rem);
  }

  @media (max-width: 52rem) {
    .services-v8__hero {
      padding-block: 2.5rem;
    }

    .services-v8__hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 12vw, 4.4rem);
    }

    .services-v8__heading {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: .8rem;
    }

    .services-v8__heading > p {
      justify-self: start;
    }

    .services-v8__layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }

    .services-v8__sidebar {
      display: block;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      background: var(--surface-1, #131413);
      z-index: 10;
      padding: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line, #282a27);
      margin: 0 -1.5rem;
    }

    .services-v8__sidebar:not(.is-open) nav {
      display: none;
    }

    .mobile-jump-menu__summary {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ivory, #fff);
      list-style: none;
    }

    .mobile-jump-menu__summary::-webkit-details-marker {
      display: none;
    }

    .services-v8__sidebar.is-open .mobile-jump-menu__icon {
      transform: rotate(180deg);
    }
    
    .mobile-jump-menu__icon {
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
      color: var(--gold-bright, #dda947);
    }

    .services-v8__sidebar nav {
      position: absolute;
      top: 100%;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      background: var(--surface-1, #131413);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line, #282a27);
      padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }

    .services-v8__sidebar ul {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 0;
      white-space: normal;
    }

    .services-v8__condition-list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .services-v8__list--two {
      columns: 1;
    }
    
    .services-v8__feed article {
      scroll-margin-top: 4rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 34rem) {
    .services-directory-v8 {
      padding-block: 2.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
